<title>JAPAN: Canon sees rise in capital investment, R&amp;D in 1997.</title>
<headline>Canon sees rise in capital investment, R&amp;D in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canon Inc said on Wednesday that it expects its capital investment to be 115.0 billion yen in the year to December 31, 1997, up from 105.4 billion yen in 1996.</p>
<p>It also said in a statement that it expects its research and development spending in 1997 to be 180 billion yen, up from 167.1 billion yen in 1996.</p>
</text>
